@startuml
' SEQUENCE DIAGRAM C — Skenario Penukaran / Konversi Poin
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
title **Sequence Diagram — Penukaran / Konversi Poin**

actor "Anggota\n(Pengguna)"          as U
participant "App Flutter\n(Frontend)"      as App
participant "PointApiController"     as C
participant "UserPoint\n(Model)"     as UP
participant "PointTransaction\n(Model)" as PT
database "Database\n(MySQL)"         as DB

autonumber
U -> App : Pilih tukar poin (jumlah / target voucher)
App -> C : POST /api/points/redeem (amount)
C -> UP  : getBalance(user_id)
UP -> DB : SELECT balance FROM user_points
DB --> UP: saldo poin
UP --> C : balance

alt Saldo poin mencukupi
  C -> UP  : redeem(amount)
  UP -> DB : UPDATE user_points SET balance = balance - amount
  C -> PT  : create(tipe='redeem', amount)
  PT -> DB : INSERT INTO point_transactions
  DB --> PT: success
  C --> App: HTTP 200 OK (voucher / saldo bertambah)
  App --> U: Tampilkan konfirmasi penukaran
else Saldo poin kurang
  C --> App: HTTP 422 (saldo poin tidak cukup)
  App --> U: Tampilkan pesan gagal
end

caption Gambar 3.7 Sequence Diagram Penukaran Poin
footer Sequence Diagram — SmartMart | Modul Pengguna & Dashboard | Tugas Akhir
@enduml
